variable pressure equal press
fix myat4 all ave/time 100 5 500 v_pressure file pressure.dat

variable etotal equal etotal
fix myat5 all ave/time 100 5 500 v_etotal file etotal.dat

variable enthalpy equal enthalpy
fix myat6 all ave/time 100 5 500 v_enthalpy file enthalpy.dat

variable myfluid atom "type==2"
group myfluid dynamic all var myfluid
variable n_fluid equal count(myfluid)
fix myat1 all ave/time 100 5 500 v_n_fluid file nb.dat

thermo 500
dump mydmp all atom 500 dump.lammpstrj